    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-query execution cost record. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures both hardware cycle counts (from CycleMetrics) and derived wall-clock time for a single query execution. Stored in the ring buffer inside <ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1phase3_1_1_per_query_cost_model" kindref="compound">PerQueryCostModel</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
